Embedding model

weights.i8, scales.f32 and tokenizer.json in this folder come from the model
sentence-transformers/static-similarity-mrl-multilingual-v1
https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/static-similarity-mrl-multilingual-v1
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0: see LICENSE in this folder.

The upstream repository declares that licence in its model card. At the revision below it holds no
LICENSE and no NOTICE file, so there is no upstream notice to carry over. LICENSE here is the text
published by the Apache Software Foundation, unchanged.

Changes made to the model
- Reduced from 1,024 to 256 dimensions: only the first 256 columns of each row are kept.
- Quantised: each row is stored as int8 in weights.i8, with one float32 scale per row in scales.f32.
  The scale is the row's largest absolute value divided by 127, or 1 for a row of zeros, and each
  stored value is the original divided by the scale, rounded to the nearest integer (halves to even)
  and kept within -127 to 127.
- tokenizer.json is the upstream file, unchanged.

The conversion is corpus-pipeline/scripts/export_embedder.py and
corpus-pipeline/src/aiwd/style/embed.py.

